_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-qw[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Jump to the last registered error with the ,L leader chord[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]When a SASE agent launch (or chop) fails, the error toast names a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]leader chord, and pressing that chord opens the Admin Center Logs [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]tab already scrolled to the exact log entry for that failure [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]instead of leaving the user to hunt through log sources.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]last_error_log_jump.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/last_error_log_jump.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-qw[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-qw/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Leader `,L` opens the Logs tab[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]keymap[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keymap: register the new `jump_to_last_error` leader action on `L` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]across the keymap dataclass, default config, dispatcher, command [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog, footer, help modal, and docs, with a first behavior that opens [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the Admin Center Logs tab.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Registered errors and error-anchored launch logs[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]registry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after keymap[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry: stamp every launch-failure log entry with a stable error id, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the session-scoped registered-error pointer, make one helper both [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]register the error and emit its toast so the chord hint can never appear[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]without a target, and make `,L` select the registered error's log [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Logs pane focuses the registered error entry[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]focus[dim] · [dim][/dim]after registry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]focus: locate the registered error's anchor in a bounded tail scan, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render a window containing it with the entry line highlighted, scroll [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the detail pane to it, and degrade with an in-pane notice when the entry[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]has aged out.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-qw","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-qw.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-0fd72150fadeae6850472396eccef10e","started_at":"2026-08-19T13:31:00.021916+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1787157746,"sha":"422c8c2c57ad248a4e12e34c3e144eeb85ffb358","subject":"feat(logs): stamp launch failures with a session error id"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"498b685f0140dd30d20ae33c17d9c3104ced80141ebfee993224ec6c333f1ef9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-qw.2/commits.json","size_bytes":235},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-qw.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"7c498